@startuml
!theme plain
title Sequence Diagram — Target Language Selection Persistence

autonumber
actor Learner
participant "Language Selection Screen" as Screen
participant "Language Store
(Zustand + AsyncStorage)" as Store
participant "Progress API
(lib/api)" as Api
participant "Supabase Client" as Client
participant "Supabase RPC
set_active_language" as Rpc
database "languages" as Languages
database "user_languages" as UserLanguages
participant "Expo Router" as Router

note over Screen, Api
Target integration: the current screen persists selection locally;
this diagram documents the intended server persistence flow.
end note

Learner -> Screen: Choose target language and continue
Screen -> Api: setActiveLanguage(languageId)
Api -> Client: rpc("set_active_language", languageId)
Client -> Rpc: Authenticated RPC request
Rpc -> Rpc: Resolve authenticated user from auth.uid()
Rpc -> Languages: Verify languageId exists

alt Language is valid and user is authenticated
  Languages --> Rpc: Language exists
  Rpc -> UserLanguages: Deactivate current active language
  Rpc -> UserLanguages: Upsert selected language as active
  UserLanguages --> Rpc: Transaction committed
  Rpc --> Client: Success
  Client --> Api: Success
  Api --> Screen: Persistence confirmed
  Screen -> Store: setSelectedLanguage(languageId)
  Store -> Store: Persist local selection for startup routing
  Screen -> Router: replace("/(tabs)")
  Router --> Learner: Show learning dashboard
else Missing session or invalid language
  Rpc --> Client: RPC error
  Client --> Api: Error
  Api --> Screen: Error
  Screen --> Learner: Keep selection screen and show feedback
end
@enduml
